WEBVTT

00:01:59.663 --> 00:02:01.538
Best-case scenario,

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:03.704
you're in a state like Colorado,

00:02:03.704 --> 00:02:06.038
and a ballot is mailed to you proactively

00:02:06.038 --> 00:02:07.788
before each and every election.

00:02:09.371 --> 00:02:10.704
No bureaucracy,

00:02:10.746 --> 00:02:12.121
no extra paperwork.

00:02:12.704 --> 00:02:13.954
The ballot comes,

00:02:13.996 --> 00:02:17.954
and the government is responsible
for delivering democracy to you.

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:21.621
Worst-case scenario,
you're in a state like Missouri,

00:02:22.413 --> 00:02:24.413
where your options are limited,

00:02:24.413 --> 00:02:27.413
you have overly restrictive
voter registration deadlines.

00:02:28.704 --> 00:02:30.829
And if you can't get off work